OL,3,GNEWSAFighting hard-to-find wildfires
OL,4,A'challenging'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocating wildfires reported by visitors
OL,7,Fin remote parts of the Lake District is
OL,8,Fhampered by their unfamiliarity with
OL,9,Fthe landscape, the area's fire service
OL,10,Fhas warned.
OL,12,FCumbria Fire and Rescue Service (CFRS)
OL,13,Fmet its 15-minute response target about
OL,14,F87% of the time this year but took 81
OL,15,Fminutes on one call-out, according to
OL,16,Ffigures obtained via a Freedom of
OL,17,FInformation request. Two in 2024 and
OL,18,F2025 took about 50 minutes.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
