OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFighting hard-to-find wildfires
OL,4,A'challenging'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCFRS group manager Scott Cameron said
OL,7,Ffinding wildfires was challenging if
OL,8,Fpeople calling them in did not know
OL,9,Fwhere they were.
OL,11,F"When the emergency alert went out from
OL,12,Fthe government, we had around 20,999
OL,13,Fcalls in the few hours after that which
OL,14,Fwere giving vague areas," he said.
